{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/oystra-zaha-hadid-al-marjan-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":19,"crm_id":"196","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Oystra","slug":"oystra-zaha-hadid-al-marjan-island","display_address":"Al Marjan Island","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Zaha Hadid","price":2800000,"display_price":"2.8M","lattitude":25.6723945,"longitude":55.7411759,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Oystra <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/al-marjan-island/\">Al Marjan Island</a> is an architectural gem developed by Richmind in collaboration with the legendary designer Zaha Hadid. The first phase of the project introduces Tower C, rising 18 floors above ground with two basement parking levels.</p><p>Oystra Tower C presents a curated selection of <strong>1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments</strong>, each offering breathtaking views of the glittering sea. Book your unit today with just a 10% down payment and secure your place in one of the UAE’s most iconic waterfront destinations.</p><p>Just moments away from the Wynn Casino Resort, Oystra by Zaha Hadid at Al Marjan Island delivers an unparalleled lifestyle experience. From sky-high dining venues featuring the UAE’s first 360° infinity pool to private cinemas, golf simulation lounges, and a luxurious European spa, this waterfront sanctuary redefines the meaning of upscale beachfront living.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Oystra_Al_Marjan_Island_by_Zaha_Hadid_2402219544.jpg","hash":"Oystra_Al_Marjan_Island_by_Zaha_Hadid_2402219544","name":"Oystra Al Marjan Island by Zaha Hadid"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Oystra_Al_Marja