n Al Marjan Island","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Iconic Design by Zaha Hadid Architects: A signature project combining fluid, futuristic architecture with coastal elegance—making Oystra a collectible masterpiece of design.</li><li>Prime Beachfront Location on Al Marjan Island: Situated on the stunning shores of Ras Al</li><li>Khaimah’s most prestigious archipelago, offering uninterrupted sea views and direct beach access.</li><li>Proximity to Wynn Al Marjan Casino Resort: Just a short walk to the region’s first integrated resort with a casino—adding exclusivity, lifestyle appeal, and future value.</li><li>UAE’s First 360° Sky Infinity Pool: A breathtaking rooftop experience with panoramic views, redefining leisure and luxury in the region.</li><li>Resort-Style Living with Ultra-Luxury Amenities: Including a European spa, golf simulator, private cinema, beach club, yoga pavilions, artisanal café, and 24/7 concierge services.</li><li>Developed by Richmind: A premium developer known for artistry, craftsmanship, and vision—delivering elevated living experiences with long-term value.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1514,"cta":{"id":2298,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Oystra_Al_Marjan_Island_by_Zaha_Hadid_9b3a08e2e3.jpg","hash":"Oystra_Al_Marjan_Island_by_Zaha_Hadid_9b3a08e2e3","name":"Oystra Al Marjan Island by Zaha Hadid"},"style":null,"title":"A Masterpiece by Zaha Hadid on Al Marjan Island","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Located on the serene shores of Al Marjan Island, Oystra by Zaha Hadid stands as a premium coastal destination in Ras Al Khaimah’s evolving real estate lands